  "about": "Job 13: which recorded sound plays for each cue. Files are assets/audio/<id>.ogg. A cue with several files picks one at random. 'group' says when its files are decoded: core at the first touch, the others when a scene or world that uses them opens (and, in Lite mode, let go again when you leave). gain is on top of the channel volume; nothing here is louder than the speaking voice. Anything missing or undecodable falls back to the built-in tones.",
